  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">All On - Powerstove Solar Homes Systems Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">POEL designs and manufacture efficient clean cookstoves that self-generate electricity and also sells and distributes PAYGo SHS where the company recruit and train women as last mile distributors of the dual charging option (Solar and Power Stove) Yellow Box/Pack PAYGO SHS that lower initial product acquisition costs, and allows users to prepay for energy days of their choice in no fixed repayment plan according to their level of income. The PAYGo SHS Yellow Box/Pack and Powerstove will provide 24hours uninterrupted electricity supply and efficient clean cookstoves that saves users up to $300 yearly.</narrative>
  </description>
